"shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"XRfhf13PcoxjuOKMKfy9WQ","review_id":"XCecYDRwTrq6obd40Lke9A","date":"2015-10-25T14:01:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9542911052703857,"text_excerpt":"Ok, who doesn't love Bud's?? This is my favorite location and it's 24 hours! I love being able to get a cheeseburger at 6 a.m. The burgers are pre-frozen and thrown on a open fire grill when you order. There is nothing fancy happening here but the taste is incredible. You can get chili, smokey red sauce, cheese (it's real shredded cheddar cheese too), and/or dressing (lettuce, tomato, etc.). The fries are usually soggy, the onion rings are not homemade, but it's still frigging delicious! I like to get a double patty with sauce, cheese and onions, with onion rings. They also have good desserts...shakes and deep fried fruit pies in cherry, apple, and peach. The peach is the best. If you buy..."},{"business_id":"XRfhf13PcoxjuOKMKfy9WQ","review_id":"9dV0JjYB4fUxhLmxO8-Msg","date":"2010-07-06T02:45:27","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9331778287887573,"text_excerpt":"Bud's Broiler serves poboys and burgers. They are known for their burgers and milk shakes. The burgers are very thin and are more like a fast food burger while being made to order. The hickory sauce is amazing. The fries are nice and crisp. And the thick chocolate shakes are just fantastic! The hotdogs and chili are great, too! Bud's is more like Wendy's than an upscale burger place. But it's good. The food has a distinct smoky flavor. This location (it's a chain) is one of the originals and has seating outside, downstairs, and upstairs. There is artwork for sale on the walls. This is a New Orleans institution and I'm thrilled to see it going strong today!"},{"business_id":"XRfhf13PcoxjuOKMKfy9WQ","review_id":"lGJP4ZxKQAF7Ac4krXqNyQ","date":"2011-09-17T22:27:30","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9329560995101929,"text_excerpt":"I can't begin to tell you how many late nights I've had where I simply CRAVE a Bud's Broiler burger. I was so ecstatic after the City Park location reopened AND continued being 24 hrs. It's like a beacon of hope for all of those who had that extra car bomb when they probably shouldn't. It's like the burgers there tell you, \"It's ok. I'm here for you.\" *nom* *nom* *nom* Great place for a late night burger for those who don't want to spend $25 for a fistful of meat slapped on a tiny bun. #4 with extra onions, side of onion rings, and a large root beer? Yes, please!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"XRfhf13PcoxjuOKMKfy9WQ","photo_id":"19UollGuusGt9d48J8MDDg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/19UollGuusGt9d48J8MDDg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9382244348526001},{"business_id":"XRfhf13PcoxjuOKMKfy9WQ","photo_id":"HYm0RdBsNFrU8J_Bbwen8w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/HYm0RdBsNFrU8J_Bbwen8w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.850678563117981},{"business_id":"XRfhf13PcoxjuOKMKfy9WQ","photo_id":"EfONMxhtQTCsElf9NNFXlA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/EfONMxhtQTCsElf9NNFXlA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8033736944198608},{"business_id":"XRfhf13PcoxjuOKMKfy9WQ","photo_id":"YNKr72b6j4fhKY7IGl4aGw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/YNKr72b6j4fhKY7IGl4aGw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7901636362075806},{"business_id":"XRfhf13PcoxjuOKMKfy9WQ","photo_id":"Xug_8J89jOXkZ7ziqpLrvQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Xug_8J89jOXkZ7ziqpLrvQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7803831100463867}]},"notebook_case":null}
